  $ym$Social Media Post - Golden Hour Crowd Portrait$ym$, $ym$Social Media Post - Golden Hour Crowd Portrait$ym$, $ym$Generates a cinematic editorial portrait of a sharply focused woman surrounded by motion-blurred pedestrians in warm urban golden-hour light.$ym$, $ym$Generates a cinematic editorial portrait of a sharply focused woman surrounded by motion-blurred pedestrians in warm urban golden-hour light.$ym$,
  $ym$Create a cinematic editorial portrait photograph of {argument name="character name" default="a young woman"} standing still in the center of a crowded urban street during warm golden hour. She has {argument name="hair color" default="soft brown"} hair loosely tied back with wispy strands catching rim light, light hazel-green eyes, natural makeup, small pearl stud earrings, and a calm, slightly wistful expression while looking directly into the camera. She wears a {argument name="coat color" default="black"} coat or blazer, framed from mid-torso upward in a vertical 4:5 composition. Surround her with exactly 9 blurred pedestrians in motion: 1 foreground left profile figure, 1 lower-left partial figure in muted red, 1 top-left partial face, 1 top-center blonde figure, 1 top-center dark-haired figure, 1 top-right male figure, 1 right-middle woman with a bun, 1 far-right dark figure, and 1 foreground-right dark shoulder silhouette. Use strong motion blur on the crowd while keeping the woman’s face sharply focused, creating the feeling that time has slowed around her. Lighting should be golden, backlit, and atmospheric, with soft bokeh, warm highlights on hair edges, shallow depth of field, realistic skin texture, natural facial proportions, and a high-end fashion editorial mood. Use a {argument name="lens style" default="85mm portrait lens"} look, cinematic color grading, gentle film grain, and no text or watermark.$ym$, $ym$Create a cinematic editorial portrait photograph of {argument name="character name" default="a young woman"} standing still in the center of a crowded urban street during warm golden hour. She has {argument name="hair color" default="soft brown"} hair loosely tied back with wispy strands catching rim light, light hazel-green eyes, natural makeup, small pearl stud earrings, and a calm, slightly wistful expression while looking directly into the camera. She wears a {argument name="coat color" default="black"} coat or blazer, framed from mid-tors