  $ym$Social Media Post - Still Woman in Motion-Blurred Lobby$ym$, $ym$Social Media Post - Still Woman in Motion-Blurred Lobby$ym$, $ym$A cinematic fashion portrait prompt for creating a calm white-suited woman standing still amid motion-blurred commuters in a modern architectural interior.$ym$, $ym$A cinematic fashion portrait prompt for creating a calm white-suited woman standing still amid motion-blurred commuters in a modern architectural interior.$ym$,
  $ym$Create a cinematic fashion editorial portrait of a young {argument name="subject identity" default="East Asian woman in her early 20s"} standing perfectly still in the center of a busy modern transit hall or office lobby while blurred commuters rush past on both sides. She faces the camera directly with a calm, slightly melancholic neutral expression, hands in her trouser pockets, shoulders relaxed, full body framed from mid-thigh upward. She has {argument name="hair style" default="short messy black layered bob with wispy bangs and a few strands across her face"}, natural minimal makeup, soft skin texture, and dark focused eyes. Dress her in an elegant monochrome {argument name="outfit color" default="ivory white"} tailored suit: single-breasted blazer with sharp lapels, matching high-waisted pleated trousers, and a ribbed turtleneck sweater underneath. The background is an airy architectural interior with tall pale columns, glass and stone surfaces, cool gray-green tones, and a polished floor; all surrounding people are anonymous motion-blurred silhouettes, creating long horizontal streaks and a strong contrast between stillness and movement. Use shallow depth of field, realistic photography, soft natural window light from the left, subtle rim light on hair and shoulders, muted teal-gray color grading, slight film grain, high dynamic range, and a contemplative urban atmosphere. Vertical 2:3 composition, eye-level camera, 50mm editorial lens look, crisp focus only on the subject, no text, no logos, no watermark.$ym$, $ym$Create a cinematic fashion editorial portrait of a young {argument name="subject identity" default="East Asian woman in her early 20s"} standing perfectly still in the center of a busy modern transit hall or office lobby while blurred commuters rush past on both sides. She faces the camera directly with a calm, slightly melancholic neutral expression, hands in her trouser pockets, shoulders relaxed, full body framed from mid-thigh upward. She