  $ym$Social Media Post - Color Powder Cat Portrait$ym$, $ym$Social Media Post - Color Powder Cat Portrait$ym$, $ym$A photorealistic studio portrait prompt for generating a seated cat covered in vivid red, orange, blue, and purple powder texture.$ym$, $ym$A photorealistic studio portrait prompt for generating a seated cat covered in vivid red, orange, blue, and purple powder texture.$ym$,
  $ym$Create a high-resolution studio portrait of a seated {argument name="animal subject" default="domestic short-haired cat"} on a clean seamless white background with a faint warm pink tint near the upper right. The cat is posed in three-quarter view facing left, sitting upright with slim elegant proportions, front paws together, tail curled along the floor in front, head turned toward the viewer, large upright ears, amber-gold eyes, a small orange-pink nose, and fine white whiskers. Render the fur as realistic and detailed but transformed by a vivid powder-pigment texture: mostly pale cream and white on the face and chest, bright orange and red speckled pigment concentrated across the forehead, ears, shoulder, back, and right flank, deep cobalt blue pigment covering the lower foreleg, belly, tail, and shadowed side, with a purple-magenta transition where red and blue overlap. The pigment should appear as thousands of tiny colored granules, splatters, and dust particles sitting on and blending into the fur, with denser color on the body and tail and lighter freckles on the face and neck. Use soft diffused studio lighting, subtle floor contact shadow, crisp focus on the eyes and fur texture, shallow natural depth, vibrant saturated colors, photorealistic yet slightly surreal fine-art animal photography. No collar, no props, no text, no watermark, no extra animals.$ym$, $ym$Create a high-resolution studio portrait of a seated {argument name="animal subject" default="domestic short-haired cat"} on a clean seamless white background with a faint warm pink tint near the upper right. The cat is posed in three-quarter view facing left, sitting upright with slim elegant proportions, front paws together, tail curled along the floor in front, head turned toward the viewer, large upright ears, amber-gold eyes, a small orange-pink nose, and fine white whiskers. Render the fur as realistic and detailed but transformed by a vivid powder-pigment texture: mostly pale cream and wh