  $ym$Social Media Post - Candid Street Fashion Portrait$ym$, $ym$Social Media Post - Candid Street Fashion Portrait$ym$, $ym$A detailed prompt for generating a candid, ultra-realistic street-style photograph of a woman, emphasizing natural lighting, skin texture, and specific clothing details within a grocery store setting.$ym$, $ym$A detailed prompt for generating a candid, ultra-realistic street-style photograph of a woman, emphasizing natural lighting, skin texture, and specific clothing details within a grocery store setting.$ym$,
