  $ym$Infographic / Edu Visual - iPhone 18 Keynote Product Design$ym$, $ym$Infographic / Edu Visual - iPhone 18 Keynote Product Design$ym$, $ym$A set of high-end Apple Keynote style prompts for conceptualizing the iPhone 18, featuring a foldable design, A20 Pro chip macro, and advanced camera mechanics with minimalist white space.$ym$, $ym$A set of high-end Apple Keynote style prompts for conceptualizing the iPhone 18, featuring a foldable design, A20 Pro chip macro, and advanced camera mechanics with minimalist white space.$ym$,
  $ym$[iPhone 18 Preview | Apple Keynote Series]

[01 | First Foldable iPhone] English title: THE FIRST FOLDABLE iPHONE. Main visual uses iPhone Fold CAD and dummy unit cues: passport-style wide body, short and wide when folded; nearly 4:3 large inner screen when unfolded; ultra-thin body; central precision hinge; horizontal dual-camera platform; white or silver metal glass body; semi-unfolded state. Realistic high-end product photography. Large white space at the top, product is huge and located bottom center.

[02 | A20 Pro] English title: 2nm. A20 PRO. Huge A20 Pro chip as the sole visual subject; realistic advanced semiconductor packaging, metal contacts, microstructure, natural reflection. Pure white or light silver-gray background, large white space, realistic macro product photography.

[03 | Camera Upgrade] English title: THE CAMERA CHANGES. Huge iPhone 18 Pro main camera macro close-up as the sole visual subject; internal mechanical variable aperture blades clearly visible inside the lens. Precision metal structure, real glass lenses, natural optical reflections. White or light silver-gray background, high-end product photography.$ym$, $ym$[iPhone 18 Preview | Apple Keynote Series]

