  $ym$Infographic / Edu Visual - Branded Rainy Office Worker Illustration$ym$, $ym$Infographic / Edu Visual - Branded Rainy Office Worker Illustration$ym$, $ym$Creates a new on-brand hand-drawn editorial illustration from a reference style, useful for reusable visual identity examples.$ym$, $ym$Creates a new on-brand hand-drawn editorial illustration from a reference style, useful for reusable visual identity examples.$ym$,
  $ym$Using REFERENCE_0 as the visual style reference, create a new single-panel square illustration in the same playful hand-drawn editorial style: thick black outlines, flat bright colors, slightly rough marker texture, simple shapes, and lots of white margin. Replace the collage with one central scene: a sad office worker walking left across a zebra crossing in the rain, holding a black briefcase, wearing a black suit and tie. Add exactly 1 large white rain cloud above him, vertical rain strokes falling only around him, a soft irregular pink background block, an orange road/crosswalk area with white crossing stripes, and exactly 2 small green bushes in the background, one on each side. Keep the composition minimal and poster-like. Add a black rounded rectangle label at the top left with white bold text reading {argument name="label text" default="AI Image result"}. Optional customization: the main subject may be changed to {argument name="main subject" default="sad office worker"}, the weather mood to {argument name="weather mood" default="rain cloud"}, and the background color block to {argument name="background color" default="soft pink"}. Do not reuse the four-panel layout or the original characters/animals; only reuse the visual brand style.$ym$, $ym$Using REFERENCE_0 as the visual style reference, create a new single-panel square illustration in the same playful hand-drawn editorial style: thick black outlines, flat bright colors, slightly rough marker texture, simple shapes, and lots of white margin. Replace the collage with one central scene: a sad office worker walking left across a zebra crossing in the rain, holding a black briefcase, wearing a black suit and tie. Add exactly 1 large white rain cloud above him, vertical rain strokes falling only around him, a soft irregular pink background block, an orange road/crosswalk area with white crossing stripes, and exactly 2 small green bushes in the background, one on each side. Keep the composition minimal a