t strongly from within the page borders toward the front. One hand placed on the edge of the torn paper. Destruction: Only the part where the person stepped out is torn; the structure of the entire book remains intact. [Manga World Description and Dialogue] Manga specifications: Must be a full Japanese-style monochrome manga layout with multiple panels. Character in manga: Same person as reference (2D line drawing), standing in confusion. Speech bubbles: 1. 'Huh...?' 2. 'Me... why am I in a place like this...!?' 3. 'Is this... inside a manga...?' 4. 'How do I get out...?' [Absolute Conditions] Maintain the structure of the open book and panel divisions while keeping proportions correct. Depict strong contrast between full-color live-action and monochrome 2D manga. [Instruction Sheet] MANGA_BREAKOUT_FINALE_PUNCHLINE [Prerequisites] Upload a full-body reference image. [Purpose] Generate a humorous 'punchline' scene where the live-action person who escaped meets the manga version, and they point at each other in surprise. [Basic Settings and Quality] Quality: Ultra-realistic 8K, photorealistic. Aspect Ratio: 1:1. [Complete Scene and Composition Specification] Manga book placement: Giant manga book in an open spread, leaning diagonally. Action and pose: The live-action person has completely escaped, turned around, and is facing the manga page. The live-action and manga versions are looking at each other with wide eyes, pointing at each other. Destruction: Part of the page remains torn. [Manga World Description and Dialogue] Manga specifications: Japanese-style monochrome manga. Character in manga: Same person as reference (2D), shocked at seeing the live-action version. Speech bubbles: 1. 'Ehh!?' 2. 'No way... you really came out!?' 3. 'Who... are you!?' [Absolute Conditions] Do not collapse live-action body proportions. Clarify the contrast between full-color live-action and monochrome 2D manga. [Instruction Sheet] 4-IMAGE_STORYBOARD_2X2_LAYOUT_COMPACT [Placement] Organize the 4 uploaded reference images into one 4-panel storyboard. 2x2 configuration: 1st=top-left, 2nd=top-right, 3rd=bottom-left, 4th=bottom-right. [Image Handling] Do not change aspect ratios. No stretching or warping. Fit the entire image into the panel and fill gaps with white. [Background/Margins] White background. 16px white margin between panels. No decorative frames. [Maintenance Conditions] Do not change the person, face, pose, background, color, or quality. Do not add or delete elements. Maintain existing text within the original images. [Most Important Condition] Do not change reference image ratios. Arrange in order: top-left -> top-right -> bottom-left -> bottom-right. Do not redraw reference images.$ym$, null, null, $ym$https://github.com/YouMind-OpenLab/awesome-gpt-image-2$ym$,
