- Generous cream-colored margins.
- Paper texture and slightly faded ink printing.
- Minimalist design with subtle vintage placement.
- Create a natural transition between the photo and the drawing.
[Prohibited Items]
- No watermarks or logos.
- Maintain natural body proportions and skeletal structure.
[Goal]
Output an editorial-style page where the photo and hand-drawn sketch coexist while staying faithful to the original subject and scene.$ym$, $ym$Create a {argument name="atmosphere" default="nostalgic"} editorial-style "photo to sketch" artbook page based on the attached photo. Maintain the subject, pose, expression, attire, composition, and atmosphere of the original photo.

