  $ym$Goal: Create a 2-column by 3-row editorial comparison grid of six AI image model outputs, each showing the same close-up jewelry photography subject: a cropped side portrait of a punk/goth person’s ear wearing a black plug-style earring with a dangling silver cross charm.

