Constraints: Keep the firearm unloaded-looking and presented only as a static visual object. Do not show ammunition, firing, disassembly, internal mechanisms, measurements, exploded diagrams, or instructions. Use exactly 4 labeled panels and no extra captions, watermarks, logos, or decorative background elements.$ym$, null, null, $ym$https://github.com/YouMind-OpenLab/awesome-gpt-image-2$ym$,
